ample: 500 kg of machine parts from Mumbai to Dubai, needed next month." required minlength="10" maxlength="3000" rows="4"></textarea></label></div><button class="button" type="submit" disabled>Review enquiry <?= icon('arrow') ?></button><p class="form-status" role="status" tabindex="-1"></p><noscript><p class="demo-note">Enable JavaScript to use this demonstration form.</p></noscript></form></section>